{"id":"09aa431166d68ab6","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-nonstationary-ideal.md","title":"Nonstationary Ideal","display":"df-nonstationary-ideal — Nonstationary Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-nonstationary-ideal","aliases":["58-df-nonstationary-ideal"],"display":"df-nonstationary-ideal — Nonstationary Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-nonstationary-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-nonstationary-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nonstationary-ideal — Nonstationary Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>（正则不可数基数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}(X,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}(X,\\kappa)\\)</span>（平稳集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span>（非平稳理想）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonstationary\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa&gt;\\omega\\to\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa:\\neg\\mathrm{Stationary}(X,\\kappa)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonstationary\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa&gt;\\omega\\to\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa:\\neg\\mathrm{Stationary}(X,\\kappa)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-完备 proper ideal；其对偶是 club filter。</li>\n<li>在通常情形下它不是素理想，因为平稳集可分拆为互不相交的平稳集。</li>\n<li>“没有超滤扩张”是错误的：在选择公理下，club filter 可扩张为超滤；等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathrm{NS}_\\kappa\\)</span> 可包含于某个极大理想。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depen